{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":32,"ref":"2-samuel 14:32","book":"2-samuel","lang":"sv","chapter":14,"translation":"Och Avshalom sade \u27e8\u05d0\u05ea\u27e9 till Joav: Se, jag s\u00e4nde till dig och sade: Kom hit, s\u00e5 skall jag s\u00e4nda dig till kungen och s\u00e4ga: Varf\u00f6r har jag kommit fr\u00e5n Geshur? Det vore b\u00e4ttre f\u00f6r mig medan jag \u00e4r d\u00e4r. Och nu m\u00e5 jag f\u00e5 se kungens ansikte; och om det finns skuld i mig, d\u00e5 m\u00e5 han d\u00f6da mig.","tokens":[{"surface":"\u05d5\u05d9\u05d0\u05de\u05e8","gloss":"och sade"},{"surface":"\u05d0\u05d1\u05e9\u05dc\u05d5\u05dd","gloss":"Avshalom"},{"surface":"\u05d0\u05dc","gloss":"till"},{"surface":"\u05d9\u05d5\u05d0\u05d1","gloss":"Joav"},{"surface":"\u05d4\u05e0\u05d4","gloss":"se"},{"surface":"\u05e9\u05dc\u05d7\u05ea\u05d9","gloss":"jag s\u00e4nde"},{"surface":"\u05d0\u05dc\u05d9\u05da","gloss":"till dig"},{"surface":"\u05dc\u05d0\u05de\u05e8","gloss":"och sade"},{"surface":"\u05d1\u05d0","gloss":"kom"},{"surface":"\u05d4\u05e0\u05d4","gloss":"hit"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05d0\u05e9\u05dc\u05d7\u05d4","gloss":"s\u00e5 skall jag s\u00e4nda"},{"surface":"\u05d0\u05ea\u05da","gloss":"\u27e8\u05d0\u05ea\u27e9","marks":"dig"},{"surface":"\u05d0\u05dc","gloss":"till"},{"surface":"\u05d4\u05de\u05dc\u05da","gloss":"kungen"},{"surface":"\u05dc\u05d0\u05de\u05e8","gloss":"att s\u00e4ga"},{"surface":"\u05dc\u05de\u05d4","gloss":"varf\u00f6r"},{"surface":"\u05d1\u05d0\u05ea\u05d9","gloss":"har jag kommit"},{"surface":"\u05de\u05d2\u05e9\u05d5\u05e8","gloss":"fr\u00e5n Geshur"},{"surface":"\u05d8\u05d5\u05d1","gloss":"b\u00e4ttre"},{"surface":"\u05dc\u05d9","gloss":"f\u00f6r mig"},{"surface":"\u05e2\u05d3","gloss":"medan"},{"surface":"\u05d0\u05e0\u05d9","gloss":"jag"},{"surface":"\u05e9\u05dd","gloss":"\u00e4r d\u00e4r"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05e2\u05ea\u05d4","gloss":"och nu"},{"surface":"\u05d0\u05e8\u05d0\u05d4","gloss":"m\u00e5 jag f\u00e5 se"},{"surface":"\u05e4\u05e0\u05d9","gloss":"ansikte